{"lines":[{"x":0.0082135492068117818,"w":0.30390144348144532,"h":0.033430233395556841,"c":1,"y":0.0058139530575510578,"t":"@MirsIELTS"},{"y":0.039935724083525082,"x":0.84764828861853025,"w":0.064457015991210898,"h":0.018965761077790799,"c":1,"t":"Test 3"},{"h":0.011270433048934714,"x":0.07354805602887074,"y":0.093244479335052088,"w":0.054028517405192045,"t":"JENNY:","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.018047266934825279,"x":0.1703506153659429,"y":0.088519038043102904,"t":"Well, this is something I get asked about a lot. There are so many distractions","w":0.61619064331054685},{"w":0.62833674112955729,"c":1,"x":0.16837783515048479,"t":"for kids these days that it can be hard to find time for reading. One thing I'd say","h":0.015997804512316471,"y":0.10465116277522302},{"c":1,"w":0.6162118021647135,"t":"is to make time to sit down with your child and share books with them. A lot of","x":0.170343852022903,"y":0.11914359886826398,"h":0.017118674534260303},{"t":"parents give up reading aloud to their children as soon as they learn to read","h":0.019374714629136758,"y":0.13509228248694716,"w":0.60196818033854171,"c":1,"x":0.17028995304544281},{"h":0.017329887232597652,"x":0.17035504911865218,"y":0.15092527431316183,"w":0.61822799682617191,"c":1,"t":"independently, but this is a mistake. It's good to read more advanced books to"},{"w":0.62833674112955729,"t":"them as it helps to develop their vocabulary. If you don't have time for this, then","x":0.17043121879099174,"h":0.014559751414971345,"c":1,"y":0.16715116299414345},{"h":0.014534883302221635,"t":"let them listen to audio books. Often, they'll want to read books they've listened","x":0.17043121877206382,"y":0.18313953508795733,"w":0.62833674112955729,"c":1},{"y":0.19738495666572353,"c":1,"t":"to for themselves. I think it's a good idea to make a mental note of the type of","x":0.16832708350974127,"w":0.61614608764648438,"h":0.017019543605568122},{"x":0.17037512734716756,"h":0.016790891889273962,"w":0.61406509399414066,"c":1,"y":0.21302833485739536,"t":"books your child is reading - often they just read the same genre all the time,"},{"h":0.018164205410487577,"c":1,"x":0.17034610467167094,"t":"which can get a bit boring. You can introduce new authors and genres to them.","y":0.22802734014760317,"w":0.62439173380533863},{"t":"Librarians should be able to help you with this.","y":0.24563953461602739,"w":0.3716632334391276,"c":1,"x":0.17043121690419522,"h":0.013081395872223012},{"h":0.015692869540864463,"y":0.25998522361446974,"x":0.077929660565668538,"w":0.41699933369954428,"c":1,"t":"PRESENTER: Well Jenny, I think that's really useful. .."},{"y":0.18001650277676129,"h":0.017873971089501062,"c":1,"x":0.83972249164387791,"w":0.065934893290201857,"t":"Q19\/20"},{"h":0.015034995740142221,"x":0.8397270533923713,"w":0.065925769805908141,"t":"Q19\/20","y":0.22794761838555799,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"PART 3","y":0.31091445409138696,"x":0.075975359329568379,"w":0.10266940434773762,"h":0.014749262536873142},{"w":0.053388086954752612,"x":0.075975360937408087,"t":"CLARE:","h":0.010174418761667026,"c":1,"y":0.34156976734215583},{"h":0.010174418761666915,"y":0.35755813942811354,"x":0.075975358885318894,"c":1,"w":0.039014374415079753,"t":"JAKE:"},{"y":0.37189141896073008,"x":0.077959092913834294,"c":1,"t":"CLARE:","w":0.049420623779296874,"h":0.0091241386436080596},{"h":0.008720930206388755,"x":0.075975358962891329,"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","y":0.38808139531831731,"w":0.039014374415079753},{"w":0.051384547551472981,"c":1,"h":0.011738641564473351,"x":0.075950437005050386,"y":0.40256091166028907,"t":"CLARE:"},{"w":0.041369495391845687,"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","y":0.4648026101251197,"x":0.075824492501911381,"h":0.010801756417153419},{"c":1,"w":0.051334702173868818,"h":0.011627907316944963,"y":0.48110465096846555,"x":0.075975359286953342,"t":"CLARE:"},{"t":"JAKE:","x":0.073921971316234833,"h":0.011627906191665427,"w":0.043121150334676103,"c":1,"y":0.52616279094486496},{"x":0.07597535982168982,"t":"CLARE:","w":0.051334702173868818,"h":0.011627906191665538,"y":0.6031976746657951,"c":1},{"x":0.078028746916096375,"w":0.036960986455281564,"h":0.0072674416511108175,"y":0.62063953496821067,"t":"JAKE:","c":1},{"x":0.0759753594133456,"w":0.051334702173868818,"h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"y":0.63517441838169664,"t":"CLARE:"},{"y":0.64970930211914391,"x":0.075975358981965543,"w":0.041067762374877928,"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","h":0.011627907316944963},{"t":"CLARE:","w":0.049281314214070629,"x":0.078028747334767348,"y":0.68168604640634523,"h":0.010174418761666915,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.69767441849936862,"w":0.041067762374877928,"t":"JAKE:","x":0.075975358961701864,"h":0.010174418761666915},{"y":0.72810824892400838,"w":0.049354413350423162,"t":"CLARE:","x":0.077992197744198313,"h":0.010353269548894373,"c":1},{"t":"JAKE:","w":0.041218763987223295,"x":0.075899858418586638,"h":0.011897762827465352,"y":0.758586002192005,"c":1},{"t":"CLARE:","x":0.075975359546682497,"w":0.051334702173868818,"h":0.011627907316944963,"c":1,"y":0.78924418579335476},{"c":1,"t":"JAKE:","y":0.82104645835916468,"w":0.041237691243489583,"x":0.075890394535372871,"h":0.010523362286323001},{"t":"CLARE:","x":0.075955912538192047,"c":1,"w":0.051373596191406232,"h":0.013158065660864859,"y":0.86624073451823069},{"t":"Hi Jake. How are you getting on with the practical teaching?","h":0.014554606637420253,"c":1,"w":0.47843943277994788,"y":0.33864306756810314,"x":0.16837781946165559},{"c":1,"t":"It's harder than I expected, but I've got some great classes. How about you?","x":0.1724306636848261,"y":0.35280243531023037,"w":0.60178064982096358,"h":0.015822513546563832},{"t":"Not brilliant. I'm really struggling with my Year 12 science class.","w":0.50530532836914066,"h":0.017928939864347182,"c":1,"y":0.36838597262600969,"x":0.17034032976452276},{"t":"Are they hard to control?","c":1,"x":0.17027523726262297,"y":0.38509577675019102,"w":0.20155103047688802,"h":0.015150278367124126},{"y":0.39970501455766261,"t":"Well, I don't have discipline problems as such. It's just that they don't seem to","c":1,"x":0.17248460637113947,"w":0.61190963745117188,"h":0.015992659734765269},{"t":"think that science has anything to do with their lives. It's depressing. They listen","h":0.014598339497164048,"c":1,"w":0.63039016723632812,"y":0.41563421842690951,"x":0.17043119977958923},{"w":0.62422999064127604,"t":"to what I say, and I gave them a test last week and the results weren't too bad,","y":0.43156342155021221,"h":0.016224188790560534,"x":0.17043120585603388,"c":1},{"h":0.013092543452890237,"c":1,"y":0.44767441833678778,"w":0.25256673177083333,"t":"but there's no real engagement.","x":0.17248460117223316},{"w":0.049281314214070615,"c":1,"h":0.013081394746943475,"x":0.172484599454473,"t":"Right.","y":0.46366279096889085},{"x":0.17043120530474454,"w":0.60780288696289064,"y":0.47817109158621274,"h":0.014561466340821783,"t":"And as part of my teaching practice, I have to design an experiment for them","c":1},{"w":0.60985626220703115,"c":1,"x":0.17248459979892744,"y":0.49410029489143348,"t":"to do. I was wondering about something on the children's diets ... you know,","h":0.013274336283185861},{"t":"asking them to record what they eat and maybe linking it to their state of health.","h":0.014582904601870728,"x":0.17248458789455648,"y":0.50872093043575362,"w":0.63039016723632812,"c":1},{"y":0.52287197880520575,"w":0.60588704427083329,"c":1,"t":"Mmm. Let's think. So your methodology would involve the children recording","x":0.17036465938965648,"h":0.017427921576485872},{"h":0.0190255044132559,"t":"what they eat. OK, but you'd also need to have access to the children's medical","x":0.17031569918218242,"y":0.53662051317312787,"w":0.6306284586588542,"c":1},{"w":0.63655029296874999,"y":0.55516224188505559,"t":"records and I don't think people would be happy about that; confidentiality would","c":1,"x":0.17043121893818,"h":0.014749262536873142},{"c":1,"w":0.63244354248046886,"t":"be an issue. If you could get the right data, the conclusions might be significant,","x":0.17043121147023782,"y":0.56976744181834327,"h":0.01607326631349093},{"t":"but I suspect it's not going to be easy.","c":1,"y":0.58720930205921651,"x":0.17453799068191339,"w":0.29774126688639324,"h":0.013085683186848995},{"y":0.61545000109257308,"w":0.48278325398763022,"c":1,"x":0.17237444677482142,"t":"Have you thought about doing an experiment using animals?","h":0.017958587601473175},{"y":0.63135553657469978,"t":"Wouldn't that be upsetting for the children?","x":0.17234369573644898,"c":1,"h":0.016885611159963232,"w":0.34119181315104169},{"t":"Well, the animals don't have to be harmed in any way. It could just be an","x":0.17241747564190188,"y":0.64746719387945106,"w":0.5730346171061198,"h":0.015460318731347455,"c":1},{"y":0.66184301324570449,"c":1,"t":"experiment where they're given a certain diet and the effects are observed.","x":0.17238332834466849,"w":0.59563954671223962,"h":0.017765425510462673},{"y":0.67866797459914441,"x":0.17446551332670054,"h":0.013884910651012827,"t":"Would I have to get permission to use animals?","c":1,"w":0.37593185424804687},{"x":0.17448221344371062,"y":0.69304358668679877,"c":1,"t":"Yes, you'd have to submit an outline of the experiment and fill in a form, but it's","w":0.62024180094401038,"h":0.016354444385629829},{"w":0.17043121337890624,"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"t":"quite straightforward.","y":0.71061946910775919,"x":0.1724845985569535},{"c":1,"x":0.17248460544290878,"y":0.72529069788099909,"w":0.58726898193359378,"h":0.014534883302221635,"t":"But if we found out that, say, a particular diet affects the health of animals,"},{"t":"the same thing wouldn't necessarily be true for people, would it?","x":0.17033195793158698,"y":0.73968498592405141,"w":0.51150904337565106,"h":0.016672710542481872,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.17233546840772457,"h":0.020821837478682714,"w":0.60604125976562506,"t":"No that's true, but the findings for any experiment are going to be limited. It's","y":0.75313791768248584},{"y":0.77203402815811728,"w":0.087024281819661486,"c":1,"h":0.012703414511891609,"t":"inevitable.","x":0.17209183084404334},{"w":0.59771967569986983,"h":0.016517446737373875,"t":"I suppose so. So what animals could I use to investigate the effects of diet?","c":1,"x":0.17238832348211852,"y":0.78487428665524561},{"y":0.80232558156548162,"h":0.013081394746943475,"x":0.17248459989869186,"w":0.051334702173868818,"t":"Mice?","c":1},{"y":0.81828908558241775,"w":0.60369608561197907,"h":0.014559751414971345,"x":0.17248460595980836,"c":1,"t":"Yes. You'd need experimental mice - ones that have been specially bred for"},{"w":0.10499207178751629,"h":0.012971186004908764,"t":"experiments.","x":0.1744527901038615,"y":0.83364926460973465,"c":1},{"y":0.84883720950831532,"h":0.014584619527721165,"x":0.17248459510347003,"w":0.46201232910156254,"c":1,"t":"OK, so what will your experiment be investigating exactly?"},{"y":0.86482558160195033,"c":1,"t":"Well, something to do with nutrition. So maybe we could look at food","h":0.014534883302221524,"w":0.54209447224934892,"x":0.1724845912880566},{"y":0.87891545402714866,"w":0.59767888387044277,"h":0.016468054847379676,"c":1,"t":"supplements.. . things like extra iron and extra protein, and their impact on","x":0.17447003914482101},{"c":1,"w":0.05995464960734051,"t":"nealth.","x":0.17228140197580444,"y":0.89632285892188124,"h":0.014040328619402853},{"t":"Q21","y":0.40116279095774199,"h":0.013081394746943475,"x":0.8398357284356035,"w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1},{"x":0.8398357284356035,"w":0.036960986455281564,"y":0.5392441858441116,"h":0.011627907316944852,"c":1,"t":"Q22"},{"t":"Q23","w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"h":0.011627907316944963,"x":0.84188911652595266,"y":0.74127906956504175},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.87268993788118865,"t":"111","w":0.036960986455281564,"c":1,"y":0.91860465142285819},{"w":0.45294118245442705,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176470218665204,"y":0.94166666659226195,"h":0.04166666666666663}],"w":2400,"h":3390}